Package: linear.algebra.r
Title: Linear Algebra from Scratch in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anna", "Astakhova", , "fanna.astakhova.work@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements core linear algebra algorithms—including custom matrix 
    operations, Gaussian elimination, eigendecomposition, PCA, and SVD—from 
    first principles in R without relying on built-in matrix operators or 
    statistical functions. Validates custom implementations against base R 
    methods and demonstrates dimensionality reduction on functional neural 
    characterisations from the Allen Brain Observatory.
